poC_acceptance_criteria:
- p95 latency under 250ms for >=95% of test runs;
- Quality regression <= 2% on eval set vs hosted baseline;
- Monthlyized cost estimate within target bands (<= current hosted spend * 1.2);
- Successful SSO/KMS integration and audit logs visible in customer SIEM;
- Runbook tested for canary rollback and region failover.
